PROJECT: Helium

Market Category

Primary Category: Decentralized Physical Infrastructure Network (DePIN) (HIGH) [Messari, https://messari.io/article/helium-depin-primer]
Secondary Category: Wireless Network Infrastructure / Telecom Services (HIGH) [Helium Website, https://www.helium.com/]
Sector: DePIN (Decentralized Physical Infrastructure Networks) (HIGH) [Messari DePIN Sector Map, https://messari.io/report/depin-sector-map]
Sub-sector: Wireless DePIN — IoT (LoRaWAN), Mobile (5G CBRS, WiFi Passpoint), MVNO (Helium Mobile) (HIGH) [Helium Products, https://www.helium.com/products/; Helium Mobile, https://www.heliummobile.com/]
