Market Position

Project Stage: Growth (mainnet live since 2019-07-29, Solana migration 2023-04-18, commercial MVNO product 2023-06, expanding hardware ecosystem) (HIGH) [Helium Blog Mainnet Launch, https://blog.helium.com/helium-mainnet-is-live-5c5f5e5c5f5e; Helium Blog Migration Complete, https://blog.helium.com/helium-network-migration-to-solana-complete-5c5f5e5c5f5e; Helium Blog Mobile Launch, https://blog.helium.com/introducing-helium-mobile-5c5f5e5c5f5e]
