- IoT connectivity: Sigfox (legacy, bankrupt/acquired), LoRaWAN operators (Actility, Senet) (MEDIUM) [Actility, https://www.actility.com/; Senet, https://www.senetco.com/]
Market Segment: Enterprise IoT connectivity (LoRaWAN), Consumer mobile service (Helium Mobile MVNO), Decentralized 5G/WiFi infrastructure deployment (HIGH) [Helium Console, https://console.helium.com/; Helium Mobile, https://www.heliummobile.com/; Helium 5G Docs, https://docs.helium.com/5g/]
Geographic Focus: United States (primary - CBRS spectrum, FCC regulation, T-Mobile roaming, Helium Mobile launch), Global IoT deployment (>180 countries historically for LoRaWAN Hotspots) (HIGH) [Helium Mobile Coverage, https://www.heliummobile.com/coverage; FCC CBRS, https://www.fcc.gov/wireless/bureau-divisions/mobility-division/35-ghz-band-cbrs; Helium Explorer Historical, https://explorer.helium.com/]
